+++ b/moldea/context/billing.md
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Billing classifications
+
+`classifyBillingQuestion` in `/src/billing.ts` classifies a message containing the exact lowercase text `refund` as `refund-review`. Every other message is classified as `invoice-question`.
+
+The project routes these classifications to human review. For refund and invoice questions, `support` should state the applicable classification and that it is routed for human review. Classification does not establish that a refund was issued, an invoice was changed, or a review was completed.

